{
  "headline": "Droperidol is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 9.1 days on hand and Corvale General has 13.2 days; the rule-recommended option is to buy from American Regent, Inc. (VAI 2024-04-24)",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include droperidol as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 62 vials of droperidol 2.5 mg/mL, 2 mL with a daily use of 6.8 vials, providing 9.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 113 vials of the same presentation with a daily use of 8.5 vials, providing 13.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for NDC 00143951425 identifies HIKMA FARMACEUTICA (PORTUGAL), S.A. as the manufacturing plant, last inspected VAI on 2023-04-21.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant received an OAI classification on 2014-03-28 and a Warning Letter on 2014-10-21, but subsequent inspections in 2015, 2016, 2020, and 2023 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E11", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from American Regent, Inc., whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2024-04-24.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
